      "q": "How much does the federal government award through WOSB set-asides?",
      "a": "The federal government obligated $691M through WOSB set-asides in FY2026 to date. The program produced 2,214 awards with an average award size of $312K, and obligations are down 45.4% year over year compared with prior fiscal periods."
