    {
      "q": "Which agencies use WOSB set-asides the most?",
      "a": "The Department of Defense is the largest user of WOSB set-asides with $340M in obligations. The Department of Homeland Security obligated $81.9M and the Department of Commerce obligated $59.5M, followed by the Department of Health and Human Services with $57M and the Department of Justice with $30.6M."
